## 4. PROJECT GROUND TRUTH — HOW THE LIBRARY ACTUALLY WORKS

Do not invent API. This is the real API from `scriptbysumothemofo.lua`. Use exactly these signatures:

```lua
local ImGui = {} -- returned by the ModuleScript
function ImGui.new(toggleKey: Enum.KeyCode) --> ImGui instance with .Gui: ScreenGui
function ImGui:Window(title: string, pos: Vector2, width: number?) --> W
function W:Tab(name: string) --> Container

-- Container methods:
Container:Text(str: string)
Container:Separator()
Container:Button(label: string, callback: () -> ())
Container:Checkbox(label: string, default: boolean, callback: (on: boolean) -> ()) --> { Get: () -> boolean }
Container:SliderFloat(label: string, min: number, max: number, default: number, callback: (v: number) -> ()) --> { Get: () -> number }
Container:CollapsingHeader(label: string, open: boolean?) --> Container (nested)
```

Behavior facts you must respect:
- `ImGui.new` creates `ScreenGui { Name="ImGuiLib", ResetOnSpawn=false, DisplayOrder=100 }` in `Players.LocalPlayer:WaitForChild("PlayerGui")`. Toggle defaults to `Enum.KeyCode.RightShift`.
- Windows are draggable via title bar (MouseButton1 + Touch supported). `AutomaticSize=Y` — do NOT set fixed Y heights on windows/pages.
- Tabs: first tab auto-selects. Tab buttons size via `#name * 9 + 16`.
- Theme table `C`: bg 15,15,18 / title 41,74,122 / frame 32,48,74 / accent 66,150,250 / btn 45,90,150 / text 235,235,235 / border 60,60,75. Font is `Enum.Font.Code`. Keep this theme unless user explicitly asks for a theme change.
- Slider uses `UIS.InputChanged/InputEnded` + `math.clamp`. Checkbox uses TextButton row for large hitbox. Keep mobile Touch support in any new widget.
- No `RenderStep`, no `HttpGet`, no external assets required in core file.

Minimal correct example (always show this shape to beginners):
```lua
-- IMGUI port made by @sumothemofo (https://github.com/justatiretbh/Roblox-IMGUI)
print("IMGUI port made by @sumothemofo")

local ReplicatedStorage = game:GetService("ReplicatedStorage")
local ImGuiModule = require(ReplicatedStorage:WaitForChild("ImGui"))

local gui = ImGuiModule.new(Enum.KeyCode.RightShift)
local w = gui:Window("Dear Roblox GUI", Vector2.new(40, 60), 300)

local main = w:Tab("Main")
main:Text("DearIMGUI")
main:Separator()
main:Checkbox("Show FPS counter", false, function(on) print("fps", on) end)
main:SliderFloat("FOV", 50, 120, 70, function(v) workspace.CurrentCamera.FieldOfView = v end)
main:Button("Reset", function() print("reset") end)
```

